OL,3,GNEWSACharity 'drowning' in abandoned
OL,4,Acats and kittens
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity says it is
OL,7,Foverwhelmed at the number of kittens,
OL,8,Funneutered cats and strays that are
OL,9,Fcurrently being abandoned at its
OL,10,Fcentre.
OL,12,FThe numbers coming in to the Coventry's
OL,13,Fbranch of the RSPCA is a lot higher
OL,14,Fthan the same period last year, up by
OL,15,F59%, the charity says - and in the past
OL,16,Ftwo weeks alone there have been three
OL,17,Fseparate cases of animals being
OL,18,Fabandoned at their Allesley site.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
