OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACharity 'drowning' in abandoned
OL,4,Acats and kittens
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager Lorraine Bryan-Arnold told BBC
OL,7,FCWR that the centre had been at
OL,8,Fcapacity for months, but despite this,
OL,9,Fbaskets full of kittens and cats were
OL,10,Fstill being dropped off.
OL,12,F"We have no room, we are completely
OL,13,Foverflowing and I feel like we are
OL,14,Fdrowning to be honest," Bryan-Arnold
OL,15,Fadded.
